1
00:00:00,673 --> 00:00:02,043
(Amy:)but it's still limited
in what it can do.

2
00:00:02,041 --> 00:00:03,271
(Sheldon:)I understand.

3
00:00:03,276 --> 00:00:05,676
(Sheldon:)She's the mean one,
I'm the fun one.

4
00:00:09,182 --> 00:00:12,622
(Howard:)Huh, they screwed up
and gave us steamed broccoli.

5
00:00:12,619 --> 00:00:13,419
(Raj:)Oh, no, that's mine.

6
00:00:13,419 --> 00:00:14,419
(Leonard:)Really?

7
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:15,650
(Leonard:)The last green thing

8
00:00:15,655 --> 00:00:17,585
(Leonard:)I saw you eat was a Skittle.

9
00:00:18,424 --> 00:00:19,524
(Raj:)Well, I can't eat

10
00:00:19,526 --> 00:00:20,556
(Raj:)like a ten-year-old
all the time.

11
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,630
(Penny:)You're dating somebody,
who is it?

12
00:00:22,629 --> 00:00:23,699
(Raj:)What?

13
00:00:23,696 --> 00:00:25,326
(Raj:)What are you talking about?

14
00:00:25,331 --> 00:00:26,761
(Penny:)You only watch what you
