15
00:00:26,766 --> 00:00:28,496
(Penny:)you might have
to take your shirt off.

16
00:00:29,369 --> 00:00:30,869
(Howard:)No, she's right.

17
00:00:30,870 --> 00:00:31,970
(Howard:)As long as I've known you,

18
00:00:31,971 --> 00:00:33,401
(Howard:)you've always been
self-conscious

19
00:00:33,406 --> 00:00:35,176
(Howard:)about your cleavage.

20
00:00:36,142 --> 00:00:37,312
It's because you keep trying

21
00:00:37,310 --> 00:00:38,780
