22
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:42,850
(Penny:)All right, fine,
don't tell us.

23
00:00:42,849 --> 00:00:44,619
(Raj:)There's nothing to tell.

24
00:00:44,617 --> 00:00:46,817
(Sheldon:)All right.

25
00:00:50,657 --> 00:00:52,027
(Leonard:)How's that broccoli?

26
