28
00:00:54,827 --> 00:00:56,027
(Amy:)Thank you.

29
00:00:56,029 --> 00:00:56,829
(Penny:)What's her name?

30
00:00:56,829 --> 00:00:57,829
Issabella.

31
00:00:57,830 --> 00:00:59,660
(Howard:)Oh, did you meet
her at work?

32
00:00:59,666 --> 00:01:02,536
(Raj:)Yes, in the telescope room.

